1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 2=

4
00:00:59,560 --> 00:00:59,880
Come here.

5
00:01:14,230 --> 00:01:14,920
Keep

6
00:01:15,310 --> 00:01:16,350
your wrist level.

7
00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:20,200
Pour steadily.

8
00:01:26,350 --> 00:01:27,310
Don't go too slowly.

9
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,070
(He smells so nice.)

10
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:36,000
(Maybe I can ask him for some
of this fragrance to make ink later.)

11
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:41,200
♪May our longing endure forever♪

12
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:45,400
He Xiaoyuan.

13
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,350
If you make another mistake,

14
00:01:47,350 --> 00:01:48,790
I'll chop off those hands of yours.

15
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:51,200
I'll practice right away.

16
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,480
But Your Highness,

17
00:02:04,150 --> 00:02:05,680
in the past thirty-three lifetimes,

18
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
the Crown Prince

19
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,080
fell in love with Miss Mu

20
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,310
at first sight every single time.

21
00:02:09,590 --> 00:02:10,710
No matter when or where,

22
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,710
all it took was one glance

23
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:14,150
for her to become
the only one in His Highness heart.

24
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:16,280
I'm not very skilled.

25
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,280
What if, before I master all this,

26
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,190
the two of them meet?

27
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,630
Then I'm afraid...

28
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:24,360
Your Highness, what an honor.

29
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:25,410
Forgive us for not welcoming you sooner.

30
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,800
Forgive us.

31
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:30,190
See? What did I tell you?

32
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,680
I really am a jinx.

33
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,520
I just had to say it,
and now it's happening.

34
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,430
I think His Highness

35
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:37,310
really is here.

36
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:38,710
So what if he is?

37
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:41,400
Then...

38
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:42,400
aren't you worried?

39
00:02:42,910 --> 00:02:43,560
Worried about what?

40
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,190
We're here

41
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,800
to see Miss Mu.

42
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,080
Well...

43
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,310
I'm terribly sorry.

44
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,080
Miss Mu suddenly fell ill.

45
00:02:52,150 --> 00:02:52,910
She won't

46
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,120
be receiving guests today.

47
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,360
His Highness

48
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,630
came especially today to see

49
00:02:57,630 --> 00:02:59,310
your top courtesan perform.

50
00:02:59,710 --> 00:03:01,560
Canceling because of a sudden illness

51
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:03,030
is quite a disappointment.

52
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:03,630
Well...

53
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,150
Take care, Your Highness.

54
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:15,190
He actually just left like that.

55
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,680
You seem disappointed.

56
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,630
Of course not, Your Highness.

57
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:26,030
I...

58
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,240
I'm relieved, actually.

59
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:32,400
Your Highness,

60
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:36,280
Mu Tingting suddenly fell ill.

61
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,120
Did you have something to do with it?

62
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:41,520
If she'll dance for money,

63
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,400
then for money,

64
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,590
she'll gladly be gravely ill too.

65
00:03:45,860 --> 00:03:48,700
(A moment earlier)

66
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,520
Miss,

67
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:55,470
someone from the palace
paid a thousand taels of gold

68
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,960
for you to suddenly
fall ill and return to your room.

69
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,470
You must not appear onstage again today.

70
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,030
- I feel so dizzy.
- Miss!

71
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,630
Miss Mu isn't feeling well today.

72
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:05,840
She won't be able to perform again.

73
00:04:09,590 --> 00:04:11,000
Your Highness is certainly ruthless...

74
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:13,470
Your Highness,

75
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,430
you truly are a brilliant strategist

76
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,510
who sees everything coming.

77
00:04:19,430 --> 00:04:20,830
If you can't flatter properly,
don't bother.

78
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,480
But He Xiaoyuan,

79
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,510
you really

80
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,600
did quite well this time.

81
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:28,120
Don't think I don't know

82
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,720
that the Crown Prince came today

83
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,070
because you

84
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,510
had a hand in it.

85
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,560
Chamberlain Shen,

86
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,920
this is the new ink Princess Yun Fang

87
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,750
asked me to make for the Crown Prince.

88
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:43,420
(Tingting)
Tingting?

89
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:44,800
Is that taken from

90
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:45,950
"the lotus standing gracefully upright"?
[*The quote hints at Tingting's name.]

91
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,360
Yes.

92
00:04:48,310 --> 00:04:48,950
Come to think of it,

93
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,070
that name

94
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:51,310
reminds me of

95
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,680
Miss Mu Tingting

96
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,360
from Ruanhong Pavilion.

97
00:04:54,940 --> 00:04:57,360
- Tingting.
- I hear she's not only a graceful dancer,

98
00:04:57,510 --> 00:04:58,630
but also highly skilled in calligraphy.

99
00:04:58,950 --> 00:04:59,950
Even scholars of the Hanlin Academy

100
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,800
praise the poetry she writes.

101
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,390
(She can sing and dance,
and she's talented too.)

102
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,160
(Isn't that exactly
the Crown Prince's...)

103
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,310
Tingting Ink.

104
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:19,160
You casually brought up
Mu Tingting's talents.

105
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:20,000
He Xiaoyuan,

106
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:22,040
you really are saying
one thing and doing another.

107
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,270
Why did you deliberately ruin the plan?

108
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:27,800
Do you actually enjoy

109
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,270
keeping the two of us
trapped in this endless cycle?

110
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,950
Do you have any idea
that my grand ambitions

111
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,390
have been stalled all because

112
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,680
of one decision you made?

113
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:38,830
Tell me.

114
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,800
It's been thirty-three lifetimes.

115
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,000
Why are you
so determined to make me fail?

116
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,630
Tell me!

117
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,630
What do you stand to gain?

118
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,600
Because...

119
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:52,240
Because

120
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,000
not winning the Crown Prince's heart

121
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:56,390
is the best outcome for me.

122
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,160
Do you even hear what you're saying?

123
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,160
If you don't love him,

124
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,370
why do you keep saving him
lifetime after lifetime...

125
00:06:05,370 --> 00:06:07,160
In the first few lifetimes,
I truly loved him.

126
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:09,680
But in every lifetime after that,

127
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,720
all I did was try to please him.

128
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,120
I wanted

129
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:16,950
my parents, who were exiled
to the disease-ridden lands of Minnan,

130
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,680
to return to the Capital alive.

131
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:20,830
So I had no choice
but to please Zhao Junyao.

132
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,310
If I humbled myself enough
and showed enough devotion,

133
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:25,040
maybe his heart would soften

134
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,750
and he would grant them
an order of transfer.

135
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:29,480
Your Highness,

136
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,480
you just asked me why.

137
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:34,390
It's because only when
he rejects me again and again,

138
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,830
only when he looks
at me coldly and says,

139
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,190
He Xiaoyuan,

140
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,360
I don't like you.

141
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,600
I don't love you.

142
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,510
Only then can I go back to the past

143
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,830
and see my parents again,

144
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:45,480
before they ever coughed up blood.

145
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,950
You asked me what I stand to gain.

146
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:49,630
I'll tell you exactly what I want.

147
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:52,270
I want my father
to take one more breath.

148
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,750
I want my mother to stay alive

149
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:55,000
and make me one more sweet flatbread.

150
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,390
I want my sister

151
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,693
to live long enough
to wear the wedding dress

152
00:06:57,693 --> 00:06:58,600
she's embroidered thirty-three times

153
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,070
but never managed to finish.

154
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:05,190
Thirty-three lifetimes.

155
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:08,920
I've closed their eyes
with my own hands thirty-three times.

156
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,070
I've closed
their coffins thirty-three times.

157
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:12,680
Your Highness,

158
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:15,830
what you seek

159
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,680
is an empire
that will endure for generations,

160
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:22,190
with everyone in the realm
bowing to your rule.

161
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:23,750
But all I ask

162
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:26,000
is to see my family just one more time.

163
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,240
Is that so wrong?

164
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,430
Then why, every time
there's a palace coup,

165
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,750
do you risk your life to save him?

166
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,510
If you don't love him

167
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,000
and don't want his love,

168
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,430
why go so far for him?

169
00:07:41,390 --> 00:07:42,270
Because when he was young,

170
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,630
he once saved my life.

171
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,270
I simply want to repay that debt.

172
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,240
He Xiaoyuan.

173
00:07:57,390 --> 00:07:58,870
I just praised you for being clever,

174
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:01,600
and now you're being foolish again.

175
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,750
Don't tell me you think

176
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,390
that after explaining all this to me,

177
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:07,240
I'll let you and your family

178
00:08:08,070 --> 00:08:09,720
live out your lives in peace.

179
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,070
Zhao Boqing.

180
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,510
In my eyes,

181
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,040
you're nothing
but a madman obsessed with

182
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:25,040
seizing power and usurping the throne.

183
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,360
What we want will never be the same.

184
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,600
Since I can't escape you
in this lifetime

185
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,440
or save my family,

186
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,240
then neither of us gets what we want.

187
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,240
Let's start over!

188
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,000
Don't you dare!

189
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,390
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

190
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:01,430
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

191
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:05,070
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

192
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:09,910
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

193
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:12,650
♪My heart has long known♪

194
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,090
♪We made a promise long ago♪

195
00:09:15,420 --> 00:09:17,040
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

196
00:09:17,710 --> 00:09:21,030
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

197
00:09:21,340 --> 00:09:24,190
♪How much must I let go♪

198
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,190
♪For one moment♪

199
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:29,200
♪To hold each other close♪

200
00:09:29,410 --> 00:09:33,730
♪Would that be enough?♪
